  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">动态树木</a>&nbsp; &nbsp;| &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terraforged\" rel=\"nofollow\">地形锻造</a>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://github.com/supermassimo/DynamicTrees-ExC/blob/1.12.2/banner.png?raw=true\" width=\"588\" height=\"240\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/A4FCBS3\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0Prkr13.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"166\" height=\"32\"></a> &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oeSBh9T.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"174\" height=\"32\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\">&nbsp;<strong>概述</strong></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;本模组旨在为动态树木和地形锻造添加兼容性。您可能已经注意到，由于地形锻造修改了原版生物群系，部分动态树木已能在地形锻造生成的世界中出现——而本模组将把动态树木支持扩展到地形锻造新增的所有生物群系中。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\">&nbsp;<strong>特色功能</strong></h2><p><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/minecraft_gamepedia/images/e/e9/Oak_Log_(UD)_JE5_BE3.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"><strong>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">世界生成</span></strong><br>所有地形锻造生物群系中的常规树木将被禁用，替换为动态树木。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/360/707/cactus.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;动态树木+</span><br></strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictreesplus\" rel=\"nofollow\">动态树木+</a>是可选依赖项。安装后，地形锻造生物群系中的所有仙人掌将被替换为动态树木+中的仙人掌物种。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SRb8VX6.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">依赖项</span></strong><br>&nbsp;•&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dynamictrees\" rel=\"nofollow\">动态树木</a>&nbsp;[0.10.0-Beta13+]<br>&nbsp;•&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/terraforged\" rel=\"nofollow\">地形锻造</a>&nbsp;[0.2.10+]<br>&nbsp;•&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffiles.minecraftforge.net%252fnet%252fminecraftforge%252fforge%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a>&nbsp;[36.1.0+]</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sC6L3HF.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"838\" height=\"7\"><strong>授权与整合包</strong></h2><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;特此授权允许在任何整合包或服务器中使用本模组。既然我已明确告知可以使用，就请不要重复询问授权事宜。所有源代码均可在<a href=\"https://github.com/Harleyoc1/DynamicTreesTerraForged\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a>查看，采用<a href=\"https://github.com/Harleyoc1/DynamicTreesTerraForged/blob/1.16.5/LICENSE\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT许可证</a>。</p>",
